Source: uv
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Krysztal Huang <krysztal.huang@outlook.com>
Build-Depends:
 {{RUST_PACKAGE_NAME}} (= {{RUST_PACKAGE_VERSION}}),
 cmake,
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 pkgconf,
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://docs.astral.sh/uv/
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: uv
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: fast Python package and project manager
 uv is an extremely fast Python package and project manager written in Rust.
 It provides a single tool for managing Python versions, projects, scripts,
 dependencies, virtual environments, packages, and command-line tools.
